{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32980","headline":"恃宠 · 曹邺","name":"恃宠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"二月树色好，昭仪正骄奢。\n恐君爱阳艳，斫却园中花。\n三十六宫女，髻鬟各如鸦。\n君王心所怜，独自不见瑕。\n台上红灯尽，未肯下金车。\n一笑不得所，尘中悉无家。\n飞燕身更轻，何必恃容华。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32980.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32980","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}